# Drives tuned placement notes, a drag-paint, the first wish (its melody stem joins on a bar
# line and fades in), a mute toggle and a day/night crossfade while the mix is captured; then
# the positional layers: water reaching the rim (the waterfall's bed, panned toward it), hens
# calling where they are, rain arriving and leaving, and the camera moving across them.
set unlock all
set clock day
click ui:build
wait 3
click ui:tab:nature
wait 3
click ui:tile:flowers_white
wait 3
click @24,34
click @25,34
click @26,34
click ui:build
wait 3
click ui:tab:terrain
wait 3
click ui:tile:water
wait 3
drag @31,28 @36,33
key escape
set played 30
wait 2
set played 34
wait 2
expect wish first_flowers done
wait 30
expect stem music/day_melody.ogg 0
# The melody joins on the next bar line and fades in over four bars (about 17 s in all).
fast 18
expect stem music/day_melody.ogg 0.99
wait 30
key m
wait 30
key m
wait 30
click ui:clock
click ui:clock
wait 110
expect phase night
set clock day
paint water @37,30 @39,32
place coop @24,30 0
set camera 38 31 2
wait 120
set camera 24 30 2
wait 120
set weather rain
wait 120
set weather natural
wait 120
quit
